      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Optimization & Refactor Notes\n1. **Scalability:** Implemented `SplitInBatches` (Loop) to process posts in chunks of 50. This prevents memory overflows during the JSON transformation phase.\n2. **Robustness:** Added `Merge Batches` to reliably collect all processed items before CSV generation.\n3. **File Management:** Added dynamic timestamp to filename (e.g., `Wordpress_Posts_2023-10-27.csv`).\n4. **Error Handling:** Added Error Trigger to catch and log failures.",
